      "action": "add-include",
      "at": "2026-09-15T03:38:59.019382Z",
      "pattern": "frontend/src/components/OpenAsDialog.tsx",
      "reason": "Root cause of the OpenAsDialog flake (#2366) is a production race: the dialog seeds its selection in a passive effect after it is already on screen, so a pick made before the effect flushes is overwritten. Proven with a MutationObserver probe (no radio checked at insertion; observed findBy=false once). Minimal fix: seed selection in the same update that opens the dialog. Manager dispatch allows production edits only for genuine production races."
    },
    {
      "action": "add-include",
      "at": "2026-09-15T03:53:38.995006Z",
      "pattern": "frontend/src/components/DataPreview.parts/coreViewers.tutorialReport.test.tsx",
      "reason": "Flake survey (218 failed CI runs + 6 re-run runs) found three frontend flake classes plus one deterministic PR-local failure. Record the regression tests for each fix; #2227 production fix already on main (f52ed20d), this adds its regression guard; docs are N/A."
    }
